direction down
colorMode pastel

// ─── Phase 1: Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Auth [color: blue] {
  chess-chat.com [icon: aws-cloudfront]
  Cognito Hosted UI [icon: aws-cognito]
  Email Verification
  app.chess-chat.com [icon: aws-elastic-load-balancing]
}

chess-chat.com > Cognito Hosted UI: login / signup
Cognito Hosted UI > Email Verification: new accounts only
Email Verification > app.chess-chat.com: redirect with JWT

// ─── Phase 2: Add a Friend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Add Friend [color: green] {
  Search by Username
  Send Friend Request
  Friend Request Notification
  Friend Accepts
  Friendship Established
}

Search by Username > Send Friend Request
Send Friend Request > Friend Request Notification: Player B notified
Friend Request Notification > Friend Accepts
Friend Accepts > Friendship Established

// ─── Phase 3: Challenge a Friend ─────────────────────────────────────────────

Challenge [color: orange] {
  Select Friend
  Choose Game Settings
  Challenge Sent
  Challenge Notification
  Friend Accepts Challenge
  Challenge Accepted Notification
  Pair Room Assigned
}

Select Friend > Choose Game Settings: time control, takebacks
Choose Game Settings > Challenge Sent
Challenge Sent > Challenge Notification: Player B notified
Challenge Sent > Pair Room Assigned: stable room code for this pair
Challenge Notification > Friend Accepts Challenge
Friend Accepts Challenge > Challenge Accepted Notification: Player A notified

// ─── Phase 4: Session Live ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Session Live [color: purple] {
  Both Players in Room
  Video Chat Active [icon: aws-chime-sdk]
  Pieces Assigned (White / Black)
  Chess Game Starts
}

Both Players in Room > Video Chat Active: Chime meeting created
Video Chat Active > Pieces Assigned (White / Black)
Pieces Assigned (White / Black) > Chess Game Starts

// ─── Phase 5: Gameplay ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Gameplay [color: pink] {
  Player Makes Move
  Clocks Running
  Draw Offer (optional)
  Opponent Responds
  Game Ends
}

Player Makes Move > Clocks Running
Clocks Running > Draw Offer (optional)
Draw Offer (optional) > Opponent Responds
Opponent Responds > Player Makes Move: next turn
Opponent Responds > Game Ends: checkmate / timeout / resign / draw

// ─── Phase 6: Reconnect (if needed) ──────────────────────────────────────────

Reconnect [color: red] {
  Player Disconnects
  30-Second Grace Period
  Reconnect Within Grace
  Game Resumes
}

Player Disconnects > 30-Second Grace Period
30-Second Grace Period > Reconnect Within Grace: player returns
Reconnect Within Grace > Game Resumes: state fully restored

// ─── Phase 7: Session End ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Session End [color: yellow] {
  Game Result Saved
  Stats Updated
  Play Again
  Room Expires
  Video Meeting Cleaned Up
}

Game Result Saved > Stats Updated: wins / losses / draws
Stats Updated > Play Again: new game, same room
Stats Updated > Room Expires: 60-minute hard limit
Room Expires > Video Meeting Cleaned Up
